title: Serannus Plan
new-page: true
subtitle: The [? if in_right_coalition: right-wing ?][? if in_center_right_coalition: center-right ?] coalition has collapsed...
tags: event
view-if: year = 1929 and month >= 7 and in_right_coalition or in_center_right_coalition and traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate"
